# AgentKredit web — environment
#
# Deployed contract addresses. Nothing is baked into the bundle: until this is
# set, every contract-backed surface in the app reports itself as unavailable
# rather than showing a placeholder number.
#
# The value is JSON, in the same shape scripts/deploy-testnet.js writes to
# deployed-addresses.json, with an optional startBlock naming the first block
# worth scanning for events. Pass a single object or an array of them.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEPLOYMENTS=[{"chainId":968,"startBlock":0,"contracts":{"agentRegistry":"0x…","reputationRegistry":"0x…","creditLine":"0x…","liquidityPool":"0x…","policyVault":"0x…","sessionKeyManager":"0x…"}}]
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEPLOYMENTS=
